# Keep build contexts small and OS-clean: never ship host build output or
# dependencies into the image (Dockerfile installs/builds its own).
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Go build output
apps/server/bin/
apps/server/vendor/

# Env / secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# VCS / editor / OS
.git
.gitignore
.github
**/.DS_Store
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/*.swp
**/*.log
docs/
*.md
!README.md
